WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.950
Signs of a reaction are clues that a new substance formed.

2
00:00:05.175 --> 00:00:08.925
Methane burns. You can't see the atoms rearrange.

3
00:00:09.552 --> 00:00:14.077
But you can see the signs: the temperature rises, and new gases form.

4
00:00:14.876 --> 00:00:19.176
Signs are clues; the real test is whether there's a new substance.
